1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:11,310
Pure green: 255 becomes 215.

2
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:22,020
The label, or the pixels?

3
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:28,370
Reader 1: the label (ffprobe).

4
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:34,720
Reader 2: the decoded pixels.

5
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,260
ffmpeg 6.1.1.

6
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:42,710
No tag. Pixels are BT.601.

7
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:50,350
Read as BT.709: green 255 to 215.

8
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:57,980
Red gains G 23. Gray never moves.

9
00:00:57,980 --> 00:01:04,270
Converted and tagged: error 1.

10
00:01:04,270 --> 00:01:13,070
Same file read as BT.601: error 23.

11
00:01:13,070 --> 00:01:19,360
-colorspace bt709 alone: error 40.

12
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:25,250
format=gray stores 76, 150, 29.

13
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:31,140
hue=s=0 stores 81, 145, 41.

14
00:01:31,140 --> 00:01:38,210
A screen shows 76, 150, 29.

15
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:45,140
Mixer 709 weights: 54, 182, 18.

16
00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:50,920
BT.709 file: gray 55, 183.

17
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:57,850
601 mixer: 149. Green 34 off.

18
00:01:57,850 --> 00:02:08,230
Default: black Y 16, white Y 235, no tag.

19
00:02:08,230 --> 00:02:15,150
-color_range pc: same bytes, tag pc.

20
00:02:15,150 --> 00:02:20,910
A tag-following player shows 16.

21
00:02:20,910 --> 00:02:27,450
Flag 1 on limited bytes: black 16.

22
00:02:27,450 --> 00:02:35,860
Flag 0 on full bytes: 8 and 247 crushed.

23
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:42,400
yuvj420p: Y 0 and 255, tag pc.

24
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:52,340
100 nit white lands at Y 127, not 235.

25
00:02:52,340 --> 00:03:00,070
50 nit patch: 67.5 codes too dark.

26
00:03:00,070 --> 00:03:04,490
Tags still say PQ.

27
00:03:04,490 --> 00:03:10,000
iall=bt2020: same pixels, new tags.

28
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:19,900
zscale: 203 nits and up all land on 255.

29
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:26,510
+ tonemap=hable: 203 nits at 182.

30
00:03:26,510 --> 00:03:31,780
yuv444p: the line stays red.

31
00:03:31,780 --> 00:03:39,170
yuv420p: the line is 150, 21, 149.

32
00:03:39,170 --> 00:03:47,610
Y stays near 81: color lost, not light.

33
00:03:47,610 --> 00:03:52,730
format=yuv420p: 65 values.

34
00:03:52,730 --> 00:04:02,960
sws_dither=none: 64 bands of 16 px.

35
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:11,490
6 other spellings: 1 checksum.

36
00:04:11,490 --> 00:04:19,760
3 commands changed only the label.

37
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:25,270
Wrong place: HDR, mixer.

38
00:04:25,270 --> 00:04:32,160
Lost: chroma. False alarm: dither.

39
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:36,460
ffprobe: bt709, tv.

40
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:46,490
Decoded: worst error 1 (as BT.601: 23).

41
00:04:46,490 --> 00:04:55,100
Raw luma: black 16, white 235.

42
00:04:55,100 --> 00:05:05,130
Plain command, read as BT.709: error 40.

43
00:05:05,130 --> 00:05:10,690
Greens: tag and pixels together.

44
00:05:10,690 --> 00:05:17,360
Black: raw luma 16 or 0.

45
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:21,810
HDR: zscale + tonemap.

46
00:05:21,810 --> 00:05:25,550
6.1.1 measured here.

47
00:05:25,550 --> 00:05:33,010
8.1.2 differs: see the source films.

48
00:05:33,010 --> 00:05:36,750
Check your build.

49
00:05:36,750 --> 00:05:41,700
